{
  "name": "View: 4D through two axis pairs",
  "description": "A 4-space with three notes, seen through two View nodes at once: [self.position.x, self.position.y] and [self.position.z, self.position.w]. Any axis pair is a View whose project.expr names two lanes; add one for xw or yz. One note drifts along +w, so only the zw panel moves. This is the plan's phase 5 done condition as a preset.",
